tags: party_affairs

= The Party School

The party is growing faster than it can train its own officials. District secretaries who joined last year are expected to explain imperialism, chair a strike committee and keep the accounts. [? if year <= 1920 : Hermann Duncker ?][? if year >= 1921 : Hermann Duncker and August Thalheimer ?] want a proper party school, with courses for the best young workers from every district.

What should it teach?

- @classics: Marx, Engels and Luxemburg.
- @russia: The lessons of the Russian revolution.
- @practice: The practice of union and council work.
- @evenings: No school. Evening classes in the districts will do.
- @easy_discard

@classics
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. The party argues better and holds together. The Spartacists are pleased.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.unity += 4;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] += 3;
}
Q.luxemburgist_satisfaction += 5;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
!}

Young metalworkers read Capital at a long table in a rented villa. Some of them will run districts in a year.

@russia
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. Discipline, insurrection, the party of a new type. The Left is pleased; Moscow too.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.militancy += 2;
Q.offensive_satisfaction += 5;
Q.independence -= 2;
Q.lean_offensive += 1;
!}

The students study the October insurrection hour by hour. Each of them leaves sure that Germany will be next.

@practice
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. Practical cadres for the unions and works councils. The Right is pleased.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.worker_support += 3;
Q.unionist_satisfaction += 5;
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
!}

How to read a wage agreement. How to run a works council meeting. How to win a union branch vote at eleven at night when the reformists have gone home.

@evenings
subtitle: Nothing spent, little gained.
on-arrival: unity += 1

The districts carry on as before, with a borrowed hall and a reading list.
